Downstream Store Integration

In the Zustand store (`src/store/useClinicStore.ts`), the `bookAppointment` method relies on this mutation. It passes its own state-derived `clinician` object to `checkAppointment`, and then spreads the mutated `clinicians` array directly into the new store state:

```typescript

